          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ak odídeš z appky, príde upozornenie „Vráť sa do SleepHole“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the afternoon you can take a nap (30 or 60 min) – only between %@–%@ (changeable), once a day. Same rules as at night, %@ to set up, an alarm at the end. A complete nap = +%lld 🪙, it doesn't build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the afternoon you can take a nap (30 or 60 min) – only between %@–%@ (changeable), once a day. Same rules as at night, %@ to set up, an alarm at the end. A complete nap = +%lld 🪙, it doesn't build."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Popoludní si môžeš dať odpočinok (30 alebo 60 min) – iba v okne %1$@–%2$@ (dá sa zmeniť), raz denne. Platí to isté ako v noci, na prípravu máš %3$@, na konci zazvoní budík. Hotový odpočinok = +%4$lld 🪙, budovu nestavia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the morning shake your phone or enter this code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the morning shake your phone or enter this code."
