    "The SleepHole alarm also rings in Do Not Disturb or Sleep focus. To get the “Come back” warning too, allow SleepHole: Settings → Focus → Sleep (and Do Not Disturb) → Apps → Add.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The SleepHole alarm also rings in Do Not Disturb or Sleep focus. To get the “Come back” warning too, allow SleepHole: Settings → Focus → Sleep (and Do Not Disturb) → Apps → Add."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Budík SleepHole zvoní aj v režime Nerušiť či Spánok. Aby prišlo aj varovanie „Vráť sa“, pridaj SleepHole do povolených appiek: Nastavenia → Sústredenie → Spánok (a Nerušiť) → Appky → Pridať."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The alarm rings even in silent mode. Pick the sound in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
