    "iOS may install an update at night and restart your phone. The building is safe (it counts in your favour), but the in-app alarm can't ring then – only the backup notification. For calmer nights: Settings → General → Software Update → Automatic Updates → turn off installing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS may install an update at night and restart your phone. The building is safe (it counts in your favour), but the in-app alarm can't ring then – only the backup notification. For calmer nights: Settings → General → Software Update → Automatic Updates → turn off installing."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS si v noci môže sám nainštalovať aktualizáciu a reštartovať telefón. Stavbe to neublíži (počíta sa v tvoj prospech), ale budík z appky vtedy nezazvoní – ozve sa len záložné upozornenie. Pokojnejšie spanie: Nastavenia → Všeobecné → Aktualizácia softvéru → Automatické aktualizácie → vypni inštaláciu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
